/*
 * docs/doxygen/api/ holds the guide's out-of-line documentation: one file
 * per subsystem, named after the subsystem's slug. Each file opens with the
 * subsystem's group (grp_ plus the slug) and holds the class, function and
 * file blocks for that subsystem, written as triple-slash comments.
 *
 * Documentation never goes into Code/ or reference/ files. The blocks here
 * name the declarations they describe, and docs/doxygen/sources.cfg lists
 * the files Doxygen reads those declarations from.
 *
 * docs/doxygen/README.md describes the id scheme and the writing rules.
 * This file is a plain comment and adds nothing to the output.
 */
